                                                "sense_id": "fec1b0bb-7294-3a67-a992-11b590217b03",
                                                "text": "page=144 Witches Spellbook is advertised [as] \"For those who'd like to be witches and get their hands on a batch of castable spells.\" This book also includes a shopping guide for such necessities as bottled bat's blood."
                                            },
                                            {
